 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's reasonable. Let the bed stand up for an hour or two before bed, and do the same thing in the morning. Set up the tent and all his gear while it's standing. Take your time. How did it read? That's the big tent for the night before. Having the tent up before bed and standing the bed make a big difference. Let him have it for just one night. Talk to him today about being cold, and the tent didn't save him. Remember your nightmare as a kid?",
